n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D237571", "files": ["browser/components/protocolhandler/test/browser/browser_registerProtocolHandler_notification.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "33b54e0b4a283c0308f15911ac6ddb8ddb201fdc", "parents": ["2f503a6aaa481cf77ea8cc449623bab7318dd464"], "tags": []}], "date": 1739374379, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "418": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sean \u003csekim@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1930742 - Add a glean probe for SSO cookie parsing success/failure  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D228715\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D237074", "files": ["netwerk/metrics.yaml", "netwerk/protocol/http/MicrosoftEntraSSOUtils.mm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2535e8f0d3b08b38438004ce5c4b51eba48fdbbd", "parents": ["33b54e0b4a283c0308f15911ac6ddb8ddb201fdc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sean \u003csekim@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1934271 - Remove GetQuery check in Entra SSO for SAML use cases  a=dmeehan\n\nThe [initial motivation](https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D216560#inline-1215772) behind checking whether the query is empty or not is to ensure that we don't perform SSO for URIs like `https://login.microsoft.com/`.\n\nHowever, we observed that Entra SSO can operate via SAML using the URI `https://login.microsoftonline.com/XXXXXX/saml2`.\n\nTo address this, we decided to remove the check like in Windows\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230714\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D237075", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "75cf163320821e4f87d4aa449c1d0755f8867fb7", "parents": ["2535e8f0d3b08b38438004ce5c4b51eba48fdbbd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sean \u003csekim@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1944119 - Refactor MicrosoftEntraSSOUtils.mm  a=dmeehan\n\nCurrently, the delegate uses nested if statements. The patch simplifies this by replacing them with return/continues.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D235688\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D237076", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/MicrosoftEntraSSOUtils.mm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "39e25bf4756f5590e59533111fbb01782729f0e4", "parents": ["75cf163320821e4f87d4aa449c1d0755f8867fb7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sean \u003csekim@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1945596 - Firefox should be still sending headers even if there are missing ones  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D236568\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D237077", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/MicrosoftEntraSSOUtils.mm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "023ef18b45715529039a3db0e68a23840e4c8356", "parents": ["39e25bf4756f5590e59533111fbb01782729f0e4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1739406349, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "419": {"changesets": [{"author": "Julian Descottes \u003cjdescottes@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1830888 - [devtools] Skip frequent macos intermittent browser_dbg-event-breakpoints.js r=devtools-reviewers,nchevobbe a=test-only DONTBUILD\n\nThis test only seems to fail on macos, and is high frequency on this platform.", "files": ["devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_aj.toml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d0748bb5c966537fefa96ab5619aaf7e2ed5b824", "parents": ["023ef18b45715529039a3db0e68a23840e4c8356"], "tags": []}], "date": 1739413227, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "420": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", 